OL,3,AInflation and government borrowing
OL,4,Ahighest for a year ahead of next week's
OL,5,ABudget
OL,6,
OL,7,FUK inflation and government borrowing
OL,8,Fboth hit their highest in a year on
OL,9,FWednesday, adding to the pressure on
OL,10,FChancellor John Healey ahead of his
OL,11,Ffirst Budget in a week.
OL,13,FThe pace of UK price rises accelerated
OL,14,Fto 3.5% in the year to September,
OL,15,Fpushed up by sharp increases in petrol
OL,16,Fand diesel prices.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,111,105,200,300,0,100
