OL,3,AInflation and government borrowing
OL,4,Ahighest for a year ahead of next week's
OL,5,ABudget
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe inflation figures came as UK
OL,8,Fgovernment borrowing jumped to nearly
OL,9,F#25bn in September, which means
OL,10,Fborrowing for the financial year to
OL,11,Fdate is running #6bn above official
OL,12,Fforecasts.
OL,14,FHealey has promised a Budget which will
OL,15,Fstick to Labour's commitment not to
OL,16,Fhike the three main taxes - income tax,
OL,17,FNational Insurance and VAT - while
OL,18,Fsticking to the party's fiscal rules.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
